🎯 TOOL OVERVIEW
What is DirSubFinder?
DirSubFinder is a professional-grade reconnaissance tool designed for authorized security testing. It automates the discovery of:

Subdomains (e.g., api.example.com, admin.example.com)

Web Directories (e.g., /admin, /login, /api)

HTTP/HTTPS Services (Checking availability and status codes)

Why Use DirSubFinder?
Feature	Benefit
Automated Discovery	Find hidden subdomains and directories without manual effort
Fast Scanning	Concurrent threading for quick results
Professional Output	Clean, colored CLI with detailed summaries
Multiple Formats	Save results in TXT or JSON for reporting
Customizable	Configurable threads, wordlists, and timeouts
Safe Operation	No exploitation, only reconnaissance
