📊 OUTPUT ANALYSIS
Understanding the Results
Subdomain Results
text
[+] Found: www.target.com (93.184.216.34) [200]
[+] Found: mail.target.com (93.184.216.35) [200]
[+] Found: api.target.com (93.184.216.36) [404]
Analysis:

www.target.com (200) → Active website

mail.target.com (200) → Mail server active

api.target.com (404) → API endpoint exists but returns 404

Directory Results
text
[+] Found: /admin (Status: 200)
[+] Found: /login (Status: 200)
[+] Found: /backup (Status: 403)
[+] Found: /phpmyadmin (Status: 404)
Analysis:

/admin (200) → Accessible admin panel - HIGH PRIORITY

/login (200) → Login page accessible

/backup (403) → Exists but access denied

/phpmyadmin (404) → Not found (safe)

Priority Matrix
Status Code	Priority	Action
200 (OK)	🔴 High	Immediate investigation needed
301/302 (Redirect)	🟡 Medium	Check redirect destination
403 (Forbidden)	🟡 Medium	Try different access methods
401 (Unauthorized)	🟡 Medium	Authentication required
404 (Not Found)	🟢 Low	Usually safe
⚠️ TROUBLESHOOTING
Common Issues and Solutions
1. DNS Resolution Errors
Error: dns.resolver.NXDOMAIN

Solution:

bash
# Check domain validity
python main.py --target invalid-domain.com

# Use a different DNS server
# (Add custom DNS in code)
2. Connection Timeouts
Error: requests.exceptions.Timeout

Solution:

bash
# Increase timeout
python main.py --target example.com --timeout 15

# Reduce threads
python main.py --target example.com --threads 5
3. Rate Limiting Issues
Error: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests

Solution:

bash
# Reduce threads
python main.py --target example.com --threads 3

# Add delay between requests
# (Modify code to add sleep)
4. SSL Certificate Errors
Solution:

bash
# Use --no-http to skip SSL checks
python main.py --target example.com --no-http
Error Codes Reference
Error	Description	Solution
NXDOMAIN	Domain doesn't exist	Verify domain spelling
ConnectionRefusedError	Port closed	Check if service is running
TimeoutError	Request took too long	Increase timeout or threads
SSL_ERROR	Certificate verification failed	Use --no-http
